{
  "sn45.160:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 45.160 ",
  "sn45.160:0.2": "12. Balakaraṇīyavagga ",
  "sn45.160:0.3": "Nadīsutta ",
  "sn45.160:1.1": "“Seyyathāpi, bhikkhave, gaṅgā nadī pācīnaninnā pācīnapoṇā pācīnapabbhārā. ",
  "sn45.160:1.2": "Atha mahājanakāyo āgaccheyya kuddālapiṭakaṁ ādāya: ",
  "sn45.160:1.3": "‘mayaṁ imaṁ gaṅgaṁ nadiṁ pacchāninnaṁ karissāma pacchāpoṇaṁ pacchāpabbhāran’ti. ",
  "sn45.160:1.4": "Taṁ kiṁ maññatha, bhikkhave, ",
  "sn45.160:1.5": "api nu so mahājanakāyo gaṅgaṁ nadiṁ pacchāninnaṁ kareyya pacchāpoṇaṁ pacchāpabbhāran”ti? ",
  "sn45.160:1.6": "“No hetaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "sn45.160:1.7": "“Taṁ kissa hetu”? ",
  "sn45.160:1.8": "“Gaṅgā, bhante, nadī pācīnaninnā pācīnapoṇā pācīnapabbhārā. ",
  "sn45.160:1.9": "Sā na sukarā pacchāninnaṁ kātuṁ pacchāpoṇaṁ pacchāpabbhāraṁ. ",
  "sn45.160:1.10": "Yāvadeva pana so mahājanakāyo kilamathassa vighātassa bhāgī assā”ti. ",
  "sn45.160:1.11": "“Evameva kho, bhikkhave, bhikkhuṁ ariyaṁ aṭṭhaṅgikaṁ maggaṁ bhāventaṁ ariyaṁ aṭṭhaṅgikaṁ maggaṁ bahulīkarontaṁ rājāno vā rājamahāmattā vā mittā vā amaccā vā ñātī vā ñātisālohitā vā bhogehi abhihaṭṭhuṁ pavāreyyuṁ: ",
  "sn45.160:1.12": "‘ehambho purisa, kiṁ te ime kāsāvā anudahanti, ",
  "sn45.160:1.13": "kiṁ muṇḍo kapālamanusaṁcarasi. ",
  "sn45.160:1.14": "Ehi, hīnāyāvattitvā bhoge ca bhuñj